WEBVTT

00:13:27.396 --> 00:13:30.636
DP: I think a lot of these concepts apply
outside of women of color.

00:13:30.636 --> 00:13:34.116
I've had a lot of white male leaders
reaching out, to be honest with you.

00:13:34.116 --> 00:13:37.156
It's still early, the book is just
getting into people's hands,

00:13:37.156 --> 00:13:40.396
but the ones who have read it
have found it shocking and surprising.

00:13:40.436 --> 00:13:42.476
They always thought they were good allies,

00:13:42.516 --> 00:13:45.596
and so the information and the stories
is really helpful to them.

00:13:45.636 --> 00:13:48.836
But they're also saying to me,
work is not working for them either.

00:13:48.876 --> 00:13:51.036
And I think that's a really
important concept.

00:13:51.076 --> 00:13:53.716
People of my generation
and younger white men, you know,

00:13:53.716 --> 00:13:56.116
want to raise their children,
want to be home more,

00:13:56.116 --> 00:13:57.996
want to have more flexibility.

00:13:58.036 --> 00:13:59.636
I think the setup of work

00:13:59.676 --> 00:14:01.956
is something that's not working
for a lot of us.